r-1q142lx r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-xd6kpl r-tskmnb r-1yzf0co r-bnwqim r-417010"><div data-block-content="47d6cd1f07e74e2b972dd6c075a1811b" class="r-1oszu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1phboty r-1yadl64 r-deolkf r-6koalj r-1ro0kt6 r-eqz5dr r-16y2uox r-1wbh5a2 r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-bnwqim r-417010"><div dir="auto" class="css-901oao r-1nf4jbm r-gg6oyi r-ubezar r-16dba41 r-135wba7 r-fdjqy7 r-1xnzce8"><span data-key="129890933b0d4cae904f9867ebcbe64e"><span data-offset-key="129890933b0d4cae904f9867ebcbe64e:0">Proses Upload mungkin memakan masa beberapa minit bergantung kepada bilangan produk anda. </span><strong data-slate-leaf="true" data-offset-key="129890933b0d4cae904f9867ebcbe64e:1" class="r-b88u0q">
</strong><span data-offset-key="129890933b0d4cae904f9867ebcbe64e:2">
Semakin banyak produk, semakin lama masa diambil untuk mengupload produk.
 
Pastikan bada ruangan </span><strong data-slate-leaf="true" data-offset-key="129890933b0d4cae904f9867ebcbe64e:3" class="r-b88u0q">result</strong><span data-offset-key="129890933b0d4cae904f9867ebcbe64e:4"> timbul tanda bewarna </span><strong data-slate-leaf="true" data-offset-key="129890933b0d4cae904f9867ebcbe64e:5" class="r-b88u0q">Hijau </strong><span data-offset-key="129890933b0d4cae904f9867ebcbe64e:6">dan semak bilangan produk anda dengan bilangan result yang telah berjaya diupload</span><strong data-slate-leaf="true" data-offset-key="129890933b0d4cae904f9867ebcbe64e:7" class="r-b88u0q">. 

</strong><span data-offset-key="129890933b0d4cae904f9867ebcbe64e:8">Sekiranya tidak sama, anda boleh membuat perubahan pada produk anda berdasarkan mesej dan masalah yang dinyatakan. </span></span></div></div></div></div><div><div data-key="0c8cd481107f40bb9500d70487fe71c4" class="r-1oszu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1phboty r-1yadl64 r-deolkf r-6koalj r-1mlwlqe r-eqz5dr r-1q142lx r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-1l7z4oj r-95jzfe r-1yzf0co r-bnwqim r-417010"><div data-block-content="0c8cd481107f40bb9500d70487fe71c4" class="r-1oszu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1phboty r-1yadl64 r-deolkf r-6koalj r-1ro0kt6 r-eqz5dr r-16y2uox r-1wbh5a2 r-crgep1 r-ifefl9 r-bcqeeo r-t60dpp r-bnwqim r-417010"><div class="css-1dbjc4n"><div class="css-1dbjc4n r-18u37iz r-1777fci"><div class="css-1dbjc4n"><div data-slate-void="true" data-key="3ad78533226c4c9d90f350972039416a"><div><div class="css-1dbjc4n"><div class="css-1dbjc4n r-z2wwpe r-bnwqim"><div tabindex="0" class="css-1dbjc4n r-1loqt21 r-1otgn73 r-1i6wzkk r-lrvibr" style="-webkit-transition-duration:0s;transition-duration:0s"><div class="css-1dbjc4n r-z2wwpe r-1mlwlqe r-1udh08x r-417010" style="height:454.1216879293425px;width:750px"><div class="css-1dbjc4n r-1niwhzg r-vvn4in r-u6sd8q r-4gszlv r-1p0dtai r-1pi2tsx r-1d2f490 r-u8s1d r-zchlnj r-ipm5af r-13qz1uu r-1wyyakw" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://docs.shoppegram.com/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-28427.appspot.com/o/assets%2F-M9wsSS6q4a48unw5U0k%2F-MBmcUvAmxlNbAvyxcBt%2F-MBmkS_XkAeL2nQC14s-%2Fimage%20(43).png?alt=media&amp;token=645894b2-a36e-450f-a2f3-d7a8d13b570e&quot;)"></div><img alt="" draggable="false" src="https://docs.shoppegram.com/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-28427.appspot.com/o/assets%2F-M9wsSS6q4a48unw5U0k%2F-MBmcUvAmxlNbAvyxcBt%2F-MBmkS_XkAeL2nQC14s-%2Fimage%20(43).png?alt=media&amp;token=645894b2-a36e-450f-a2f3-d7a8d13b570e" class="css-9pa8cd"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div data-key="a5418d20dbc74f4bb562ed94f5be02a2" class="r-1oszu61 r-1xc7w19 r-1